\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n重构了`MatMulKernelDeterministicSplitK`函数中针对`isL2cacheSplit`分支的逻辑。将原先在条件编译块内定义类型别名的方式，改为在调用具体计算函数时，根据输入张量的格式标志（`isNzA`/`isNzB` 或 `nd2nzA`/`nd2nzB`），显式地选择并实例化对应的模板类型。修改确保了代码能够正确区分四种输入格式组合（A/B均为ND、A为NZ/B为ND、A为ND/B为NZ、A/B均为NZ），并调用相应的计算路径，消除了原代码中类型定义与实际使用脱节的问题，保证了计算的正确性。","created_at":"2026-03-02T11:39:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-02T11:39:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163983650,"discussion_id":"f967b2c6af6e3b47269061dc772a52449e06ef69","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-02T14:26:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-02T14:26:26+08:00","user":{"id":"6822bdee053cff786c91041b","login":"chaotang233","object_id":"6822bdee053cff786c91041b","name":"唐超","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chaotang233"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163997046,"discussion_id":"bfbbbe89afe5e7ab4de52bc04227b945e5873031","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-02T15:36:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-02T15:36:34+08:00","user":{"id":"675270e63397591218ac535b","login":"sxb154714","object_id":"675270e63397591218ac535b","name":"sxb154714","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ee/be/575e1e8076be411c5002aa4400569525777aaeeb4f9ee19c332213194abb5489.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/sxb154714"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163997094,"discussion_id":"0419f8dc3a9cb730ec1046daefe1c8c6275cb902","body":"### Review Guide\n\n This pull-request **passes review**.\n Committers who wrote a comment of `/approve` are: [*chaotang233*](https://gitcode.com/chaotang233), [*sxb154714*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714).\nReviewers who wrote a comment of `/lgtm` are: [*chaotang233*](https://gitcode.com/chaotang233), [*sxb154714*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714).\n","created